with $f(u) = 2$, contradiction. Hence $W \\ge 2$ universally.\n18:    \n19: 2. **Cardinality Expansion of Reachability Balls**:\n20:    Define $B_k(v) = \\text{ballWithin } G\\ k\\ v$.\n21:    \n<truncated 447 bytes>\nevery $v \\in V$.\n26:    - Consequently, $\\text{rad}(G) \\le |V| - 1 \\iff \\text{rad}(G) + 1 \\le |V|$.\n27: \n28: 3. **Subcases**:\n29:    - If $|V| \\le W$, then $\\text{rad}(G) + 1 \\le |V| \\le W$. (Proved & Verified)\n30:    - If $\\text{rad}(G) \\le 1$, then $\\text{rad}(G) + 1 \\le 2 \\le W$. (Proved & Verified)\n31:    - If $W < |V|$ and $\\text{rad}(G) \\ge 2$, at least one vertex $u_0$ has $f(u_0) = 2$.\n32:      - If $|f^{-1}(2)| = 1$, $u_0$ dominates all of $V \\setminus f^{-1}(1)$, so $|V \\setminus B_1(u_0)| \\le |f^{-1}(1)| \\le W - 2$. By expansion, $B_{W-1}(u_0) = V$, so $\\text{rad}(G) \\le W - 1 \\iff \\text{rad}(G) + 1 \\le W$.\n33:      - If $|f^{-1}(2)| \\ge 2$, $W \\ge 4$, and paths between stars bound radius strictly below $W$.\n34: \n35: ---\n36: \n37: ## 3. Verified Lean 4 Lemmas in `scratch.lean`\n38: \n39: The following lemmas are fully elaborated and checked:\n40: \n41: ```lean\n42: lemma minUpTo_le {n : ℕ} {p : ℕ → Prop} [DecidablePred p] (k : ℕ) (hk : k ≤ n) (hp : p k) :\n43:     minUpTo n p ≤ k\n44: \n45: theorem radius_le_eccentricity {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n46:     (G : SimpleGraph V) 